<p><strong><em>Far from the bustle of cities and towns, past the hedges that shelter the most distant farms from the terrors of the wild, amid the dense-packed trees of trackless forests and across wide and empty plains, rangers keep their unending watch.</em></strong></p>
<p>Source: Unearthed Arcana 8, Ranger</p>
